{"obsah":"<p>After quite a while, Vlasta and Lukáš went to see Vláďa Keblůžek in Lipová near Cheb, where the village ball was held. Besides a performance by dancers from StarDance, there was a midnight surprise led by the Trialshow team. A great audience atmosphere and a few actors with suicidal tendencies in the role of volunteers helped us a lot. The spectators also dived headfirst into the competition, and thanks to the great surface and high ceiling we managed to show plenty of tricks. Thanks for the invitation – hopefully see you again sometime.</p>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F12%2FWhatsApp-Image-2025-12-07-at-20.19.41-1.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F12%2FWhatsApp-Image-2025-12-07-at-20.19.41-1.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-251106\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F12%2FWhatsApp-Image-2025-12-07-at-20.19.41.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F12%2FWhatsApp-Image-2025-12-07-at-20.19.41.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-251108\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F12%2FWhatsApp-Image-2025-12-07-at-20.19.42-1.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F12%2FWhatsApp-Image-2025-12-07-at-20.19.42-1.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp